course: dictionary
lesson: 12369
title: Crossbar: the bar across the top
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A crossbar is a bar that goes across between two upright posts. Look inside the word: cross means across, and bar is a long piece of wood or metal. That is the clue to its meaning.
explain: «The shot hit the crossbar and bounced out.» The ball did not go in, but it came close. The word hit tells you something hard touched the bar. Ask yourself: if I say "the ball hit the bar across the top of the goal", does the sentence still make sense? Yes, so that is the meaning.
explain: The same word can name other things. A crossbar can be the bar between a bicycle's seat and handlebars, or the bar a jumper must clear in the high jump. The sentence around the word tells you which one is meant.
fact: A crossbar is a bar that goes across between two upright posts.
fact: «The shot hit the crossbar» means the ball nearly went in the goal.
fact: In the high jump, the crossbar is the bar the jumper must go over.
fact: On a bicycle, the crossbar is the bar between the seat and the handlebars.
fact: Riding on a friend's bike crossbar is not safe, so never do it.
exercise: «The shot hit the crossbar and bounced out.» What is the crossbar in this sentence? | The grass in front of the goal | The team's coach | The net behind the goal | *The bar across the top of the goal
exercise: In the high jump, what must the jumper go over? | *The crossbar | The bench | The mat | A rope
exercise: Which part is the crossbar on a bicycle? | The wheel | The pedal | The bell | *The bar between the seat and the handlebars
test: «The ball smacked the crossbar and the crowd groaned.» Why did the crowd groan? | *The ball nearly went in the goal | The referee blew the whistle for lunch | The ball was kicked into the crowd | The players were tired from running
test: In crossbar, what does the word cross mean? | Angry | A church | Two halves | *Across
exam: «Max sat on the crossbar of his friend's bike.» Why is this a bad idea? | *It is not safe | It is the best seat on a bike | It helps the brakes work | It makes the bike go faster
